# Image references hack/image-list.sh --coverage expects to keep their names
# when the image override table renames every image a chart renders, one per
# line as <chart> <image name pattern> <Kind/name, (extracted) or *>, each with
# its reason. Remove a line once the reference follows the table.

# Upstream's image-config keeps its defaults; the RELATED_IMAGE_* env the
# patch adds overrides each, which the guard checks separately.
system/piraeus-operator * ConfigMap/release-piraeus-image-config
# The operator's fallback for OLM: imagePath reads the ClusterPolicy triple
# first, which the patched template sets.
system/gpu-operator nvcr.io/nvidia/cloud-native/k8s-driver-manager Deployment/gpu-operator
# The Talos installer of tenant workers is configured through
# talos.installerRepository, its own value, rather than the table.
apps/kubernetes-nodes factory.talos.dev/installer/* *
